# Lady of Laughter ({3}{W}{W}, 4/5 flying): "Celebration — At the beginning of your end step, if two or more nonland permanents
# entered the battlefield under your control this turn, draw a card" (CR 207.2c, 603.4). On turn three Bot1 plays a Plains, casts
# Black Lotus (a nonland permanent that is sacrificed at once, which still counts) and the Lady: exactly two, so the end step
# draws a card (4 cards in hand after casting, 6 at the start of turn five with the draw step's). On turn five a Plains and a
# Memnite are only one nonland permanent, so no card is drawn at that end step (4 cards in hand after playing both, 5 at the
# start of turn seven, the draw step's alone).

